OL,3,GNorth West                             
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with     
OL,6,Fmostly clear spells or lengthy clear   
OL,7,Fskies this evening and overnight. This 
OL,8,Fwill lead to a touch of frost in       
OL,9,Fplaces by dawn, although less cold     
OL,10,Fthan on Friday night. A breezier night 
OL,11,Ffor many.                              
OL,13,CSunday:FLong sunny spells amongst      
OL,14,Fpatches of cloud, especially along the 
OL,15,Fcoast. Though temperatures wil be      
OL,16,Fslightly raised compared to Friday, it 
OL,17,Fwill feel cold in the easterly breeze. 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
